WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.200
Inside the Drone Innovation Lab,

00:00:02.280 --> 00:00:04.400
students explore aerial imaging,

00:00:04.480 --> 00:00:05.450
mission planning,

00:00:05.500 --> 00:00:06.740
and responsible drone use

00:00:06.740 --> 00:00:09.500
while building teamwork
and future-ready skills.
